Pv9a","url":"https://x.com/geekbb/status/2114280044260716686"},{"author_id":"1400012445154889731","created_at":"2026-10-25T08:47:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114277579763110300"],"id":"2114277579763110300","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":5830,"like_count":42,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":6},"text":"告诉兄弟们个秘密：智者允许一切的发生，然后顺势而为。\n\n这些年，我听过最有力量的一句话应该是：允许一切的发生。\n\n你的很多痛苦，根源就在：你不允许一些事的发生，你觉得应该朝着你期待的方向发展，结果没有，于是痛苦难受就诞生了。","url":"https://x.com/DtDt666/status/2114277579763110300"},{"author_id":"143810986","created_at":"2026-10-25T08:39:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114275622952620070"],"id":"2114275622952620070","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":9078,"like_count":52,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":12},"text":"从儿童玩具、CD光盘到香烟，价值数十亿欧元的假冒商品正大量涌入欧盟市场。欧盟知识产权局年度报告显示，执法部门查获的假货数量再创新高，而德国在其中一项统计里排名靠前。这些假货主要来自哪里？详细报道请戳https://t.co/Pwob5CoapT https://t.co/1eEzrHU15n","url":"https://x.com/dw_chinese/status/2114275622952620070"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-25T08:34:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114274309287846257"],"id":"2114274309287846257","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11354,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"美国六旗游乐园（Six Flags）发生过山车乘客坠落身亡事故后，宣布将在旗下部分过山车增设安全带，并对所有游乐设施展开安全检查，以加强乘客安全。 https://t.co/LzTnyFRwOn","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2114274309287846257"},{"author_id":"20845447","created_at":"2026-10-25T08:31:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114273580481732736"],"id":"2114273580481732736","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4485,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"日本30%以上大企业遭受网络攻击 自民党呼吁建立首相主导的对应体制 rfi.​my/D9zh https://t.co/km7xHoeNmU","url":"https://x.com/RFI_Cn/status/2114273580481732736"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-25T08:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":